{"id":"n74177-6-5","stage":1,"title":"밀다 · 擀","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74177-6-5-1","ko":"밀가루 반죽을 다 했는데 다음에는 무엇을 하면 되나요?","zh":"面粉面团已经做好了，接下来该做什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밀가루","meaning":"面，面粉","explanation":"밀가루：面，面粉","readings":[{"term":"밀가루","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57411","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반죽을","meaning":"和，拌","explanation":"반죽：和，拌；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반죽","audio":"/audio/61a2d6e7624bbd0bf104.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15855","senseId":"1","lemma":"반죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에는","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"db2374a87cd050f0","term":"밀가루","zh":"面，面粉","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3","entryId":"57411","definition":"由小麦磨成的粉末。","pronunciation":["밀까루"]},{"id":"61a2d6e7624bbd0b","term":"반죽","zh":"和，拌","audio":"/audio/61a2d6e7624bbd0bf104.mp3","entryId":"15855","definition":"在面粉里放水搅拌调匀；或指那样做。","pronunciation":["반죽"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7181f0f104ae41f7c373.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74177-6-5-2","ko":"이제 밀대로 반죽을 얇게 미세요.","zh":"现在用擀面杖把面团擀薄吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀대로","meaning":"擀面杖","explanation":"밀대：擀面杖；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밀대","audio":"/audio/c559f37c4e482f43380b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:밀대:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀대","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"반죽을","meaning":"和，拌","explanation":"반죽：和，拌；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반죽","audio":"/audio/61a2d6e7624bbd0bf104.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15855","senseId":"1","lemma":"반죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얇게","meaning":"薄","explanation":"얇다：薄；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"얇다","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89859","senseId":"1","lemma":"얇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미세요.","meaning":"擀，压","explanation":"밀다：擀，压；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"밀다","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74177","senseId":"6","lemma":"밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"c559f37c4e482f43","term":"밀대","zh":"擀面杖","audio":"/audio/c559f37c4e482f43380b.mp3","definition":"本句指用来将面团擀薄的工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"61a2d6e7624bbd0b","term":"반죽","zh":"和，拌","audio":"/audio/61a2d6e7624bbd0bf104.mp3","entryId":"15855","definition":"在面粉里放水搅拌调匀；或指那样做。","pronunciation":["반죽"]},{"id":"7dbc70519003a2d1","term":"얇다","zh":"薄","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3","entryId":"89859","definition":"厚度不厚。","pronunciation":["얄ː따"]},{"id":"2e251676952afc35","term":"밀다","zh":"擀，压","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3","entryId":"74177","definition":"压平，使之变薄。","pronunciation":["밀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/93f383d366fddf4ad03b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.61,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74177","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1621,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在用擀面杖把面团擀薄吧。","面粉面团已经做好了，接下来该做什么呢？","要搬运的物品就这些吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["面粉面团已经做好了，接下来该做什么呢？","要搬运的物品就这些吗？